{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.poster.avif?t=1772457189\" width=578 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/2d92e5bd80aef3d43cceffaf8611c473.webm?t=1772457189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=\uff3e\u25cf \u22cf \u25cf\uff3e=</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Sweet Whiskers: Cozy Kitty Stories</strong>, a cozy and relaxing bubble merge puzzle game set in a stylish anime caf\u00e9 run by charming neko girls. Match and merge colorful sweets to unlock new characters and progress through fun, dessert-themed challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf70 Core Gameplay<br>At the heart of the game is a satisfying bubble merge mechanic \u2014 drag and combine matching sweets on the puzzle board to create new ones, complete level objectives, and earn delicious cakes.<br>Every few levels, a new character is revealed, adding variety and charm to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single, elegant caf\u00e9 managed by unique anime-style neko girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 9 different girls, each unlocked by completing 3 bubble merge puzzle levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and rewarding merging system with clever layouts and gameplay twists like portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn anime visuals with polished details and soothing background music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through relaxing levels and enjoy visually delightful rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of laid-back puzzle games with merging mechanics, cute character design, and a relaxing vibe, <strong>Sweet Whiskers: Cozy Kitty Stories</strong> is your perfect treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lily","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765830/e77b3d69f698d17101be5cd915711a3bf6ed9df6.jpg"},{"name":"Belle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765830/27cf669fbff47d2eef760183bbca250f16d157ff.jpg"},{"name":"Emilia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765830/e0feca58a72ad87c550676894e979f1bebd5a3dd.jpg"},{"name":"Serena","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765830/7568b454a6ef4a44608b24da05df5e4d1cdd5780.jpg"},{"name":"Naomi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765830/d07591e83327fd7cabfaeca5a49a3827643699b9.jpg"},{"name":"Rin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765830/12f28975a3434431987588aaa15755e146d9c1ed.jpg"},{"name":"Mia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765830/8879684d8df89735f229a55cfcb958ecc86d1a22.jpg"},{"name":"Yuki","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765830/a2fa5ef8f740895558f19886a034ac8efe27204a.jpg"},{"name":"Saya","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3765830/73ccd30e02cd80dfa69edd46c85822671be4d9f6.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765830?t=1772457189","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/3b56f414e0fefbddeaac4b1442255fd776ebf041/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772457189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/0c9660f5ca8dbdddae62c691be96e28147787ecf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772457189","capsule_imagev5":"https://s